      "en_US": [
        "By the way, you’re a Poké Maniac...\n",
        "I can tell. Yes, you are.\r",
        "But your knowledge is shallow still!\r",
        "Do you know Bill?\n",
        "He’s an incredible Poké Maniac.\f",
        "I revere him.\r",
        "I’ll teach you all I know about Bill,\n",
        "so leave me your phone number. {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0688_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Bill--he’s more than amazing!\r",
        "To be a Poké Maniac like him someday...\n",
        "That’s my dream."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0688_00003",
      "en_US": "You’re definitely going to regret it..."
