    {
      "id": "msg_0688_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll teach you all I know about Bill,\n",
        "so leave me your phone number. {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0688_00005",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0688_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh? Do you like to talk to\n",
        "people nearby over the phone?\r",
        "You know, this is how I talk to my\n",
        "mother when I’m home?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0688_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh yeah, I got an extremely rare\n",
        "Pokémon in a trade a while back.\r",
        "Do you want to know what it is?\n",
        "Hehe, I’m keeping it a secret!\r",
        "So that’s it then."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0688_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh yeah, I took down this wild\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}.\r",
        "It wasn’t rare enough to bother\n",
        "catching.\r",
        "So that’s it then."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0688_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh yeah, I saw a rare Pokémon about\n",
        "an hour ago.\r",
        "It was my first sighting. But I\n",
        "didn’t have any Poké Balls...\r",
        "Would Bill laugh at my mistakes?\r",
        "So that’s it then."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0688_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Did you know...?\n",
